abstract: >-
  Stationary-drive impurity-resonance manuscript and numerical checks. Includes
  the U=0 full-bath EP, finite-U KR saddles, finite-chain embedding diagnostics
  and an explicitly separate spin-symmetric interacting dimer comparison.
  Exact interacting continuum and local-moment EP survival in the original
  driven SOC model remain unresolved.
